{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e7bd62f8caf418bd8b99fa83bbabdc485587dd2698bea959e99e5f0631ba521b", "ja": "（『Beat the World!!!』が大好評の真と歩は\n雑誌で特集を組んでもらえることになったが……）", "zh": "（由于《Beat the World!!!》大受好评，真和步得以在杂志上接受专题报道，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "415f98be4e0982f2201f0aaca7e1e227e94293e3fecf4fc1baaa6de509dddfde", "ja": "うーん、来ないですね、歩。\nそろそろ取材、始まっちゃいますよ。", "zh": "嗯——还没来啊，步。\n采访差不多要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c95ab638797b88cb270eac400b877810da91aa60450c1821c272bc0fbb30c09e", "ja": "前の仕事がだいぶ押したみたいだからな。\n少しくらいなら、待ってもらえると思うけど……。", "zh": "看来她之前的工作耽搁了不少时间。\n不过稍微等一会儿应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "a3af4a3bed4cb6b893f9ff40debaf64032eaaa40c8b9da9a96beb167001ecfec", "ja": "間に合ってくれるといいなあ。\n先にボクだけでインタビュー、とか言われても……。", "zh": "希望他能及时赶到啊。要是被要求先让我一个人接受采访什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "92b20ebb0ccb54f20ade33dbb25a42ffeb1ad61404d4c85a9a361a7fac1fd37a", "ja": "ボク、歩のノリに合わせるつもりだったから、\n何を話すか、全然準備してなくて。", "zh": "我本来打算配合步的节奏，所以完全没准备要聊什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f661071f35aca083cd1e092641f3eca9ce5483c24e286e28ac8b0e1129fd42e3", "ja": "そうだったのか。あれ、でも歩はトーク苦手だって、\nいつも自分でいってたよな？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。不过，步不是总说自己不擅长聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "fec8d777b2cd412b3dd491f9b85f06037ccb8753e4df4ead1ec6302e019b0eae", "ja": "そうなんですけど、ニューヨークの話なんかは歩に\nしゃべってもらったほうが、絶対面白いと思って……。", "zh": "虽然是这样，不过像纽约之类的话题，我觉得还是让步来说肯定更有意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "da273c6adc737e592bdee5b6d48ec8d9ee4466fef6f0627d80995fbb298d6b67", "ja": "事前に相談しておけばよかったな……。\nとりあえず、もう少し待とう。", "zh": "要是事先商量一下就好了……\n总之，再稍微等一等吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1008_se", "source_sha256": "7e6bdce7a1b69c7f9b6e21ea7b7d4e801ea100a09e5281a37bc281d69dc83115", "ja": "ピロン♪", "zh": "叮咚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "9d03a0bb23800f42c48712c36630c42da68a5c1f27332ebf981cd3f01c9ef89d", "ja": "あれ？　スマホに着信だ。歩からですね。\nこれは……歩のダンスの動画？", "zh": "咦？手机收到消息了。是步发来的呢。\n这是……步跳舞的视频？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fcce567391eeb2637a3013b106d3f78e0f89cf66325474c9d8b9f423b6a32054", "ja": "え？　どうして今、そんなものを？", "zh": "诶？为什么现在发这种东西过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "f6dec70ded27320de45bc0322a39a0d6d51fd94c6c004fe026ff31422d92fcb5", "ja": "あれ、この振り付け古いんじゃ……？　あ、そうか。\nこれ、レコーディングで歩が踊ったヤツです！", "zh": "咦，这段动作不是老版的吗……？啊，对哦。\n这是录音时步跳过的那段！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2b972a5d426f1f32a574ab8fb17be388898876da4ea076a4be9274d2d6aba525", "ja": "へえ、あの時ふたりが勢いで踊った時の……って、\nあんな即興ダンス、ふたりとも覚えてるのか！？", "zh": "哦，是那时候你们俩一时兴起跳的那段……等等，这种即兴舞蹈，你们两个居然都记得吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "16db0a9ec668245aed659a01d06c11d3b096a87754d5737b5372d615a1c078e7", "ja": "まあ、ダンスはパターンの組み合わせですからね。\nそれにボク達、お互いの感覚も掴んでますから。", "zh": "哎呀，毕竟跳舞就是各种动作套路的组合嘛。\n而且我们也已经掌握彼此的感觉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "76ed2572c59cd2e9d92419e1ee5c8f37a6b9c117a457e81914001c65da9b55c2", "ja": "それも、レコーディングの時にいろいろあったから\nですけど……あ、そうか。その話をすればいいんだ！", "zh": "不过，这也是因为录音时发生了不少事情……啊，对了。说起那件事就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2e1d0d1fd612a73a7bdc2f4563658723eca4101dd321bcbe39a7cb360655a1cf", "ja": "なるほど……。はっ！　もしかして歩は、\nそれを伝えるためにこの動画を……？", "zh": "原来如此……啊！难道说，步是为了把这件事告诉我们，才拍了这段视频……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "72b488783a5423ab64a14ea594423c021c7c8e44627271edf251e6b7fb35eb91", "ja": "そうかもしれません！　ボク達、ダンスで気持ちを\n伝えられますから！　うん、さすが歩です！", "zh": "也许真是这样！因为我们可以通过舞蹈传达心情！嗯，不愧是阿步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1b4c5463d0f9fba025c7b03ecb6c8eac05d038575e75254717bdddb3d4072f16", "ja": "……でも、さすがにこれは……。\nメッセージを打った方が、早いと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "……不过，这也未免太……\n我想还是打字发消息更快吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "e21bc53c3a279ca408a644643eea1339f965a179c296c9d809262c4a12ec45c9", "ja": "えっ？　……それもそうか。じゃあ、どうして？\nよし、歩の気持ちになって……うーん……。", "zh": "咦？……这么说也有道理。那，她为什么要这样做？\n好，站在步的立场上想想……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "51103dc5a2e9752fd7b2ac401e9b100002f6ba13f71138e3da43a6d0ac879345", "ja": "……はっ。ボク、わかった気がします。\n歩はたぶん……ものすごく、慌てています！！", "zh": "……啊。我想我明白了。\n步大概……慌张得不行了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fc71ecf31a092047710619decb01346e08348ea01281c2470ea36b9ffd590753", "ja": "誤操作だな、わかった！　歩はまだ来ない！！\n真、先にスタンバイしてくれ！！", "zh": "是误操作吧，明白了！歩还没到！！真，先去待命！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "a3f348e476aabb9a5fffeb7c99e0fabdc6a0934e7714da5f30d34ea4219f4e64", "ja": "わかりました！　大丈夫、ニューヨークで\n歩にもらった気持ちも、見直せましたから。", "zh": "明白了！没事的，在纽约从\n步那里感受到的心意，我也重新回顾过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0133_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "b264bc1c0b9270744ad2edebd31b258bf3f61fabfe14050dbb25e1132e72c4ec", "ja": "へへっ、歩の分までボク、がんばってきますね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我会连步的那份一起加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
